WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
What do you think

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,440
What should the chef do now?

3
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:04,760
I just say it casually

4
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:08,830
Just listen to it and be the first

5
00:00:08,830 --> 00:00:10,150
Ready for war

6
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:11,630
Not necessarily right away

7
00:00:11,630 --> 00:00:14,180
But capable generals must be promoted first

8
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:17,140
To avoid having no generals available during wartime

9
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:18,220
The war drum sounds

10
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:19,420
Golden food

11
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:20,980
Fighting requires money and food

12
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:22,660
So we need to replenish the national treasury first

13
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:23,860
With money, treatment

14
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:27,460
Only by fighting can the Northern Barbarians be subdued and disabled.

15
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:29,340
Even destroy the country

16
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:35,510
It would be a good idea to defeat the Northern Barbarians until they destroy the country.

17
00:00:35,510 --> 00:00:37,370
Gradually still thirsty

18
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:39,880
You are indeed a piece of cake.

19
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:41,200
Thank you for the compliment

20
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:44,430
You are not humble, Brother Chu

21
00:00:44,430 --> 00:00:46,110
Are you going to Wenxiang Pavilion tonight?

22
00:00:46,110 --> 00:00:47,590
let's go together

23
00:00:47,590 --> 00:00:51,940
What nonsense did you do last night if I didn’t bring the wooden eagle with me this time?

24
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:56,030
You went to Wenxiang Pavilion, father

25
00:00:56,030 --> 00:00:58,350
The child has lost his ability to examine the sufferings of the world.

26
00:00:58,350 --> 00:00:59,270
Not really
